<title>CANADA: MDC lands deals worth C$11.6 million.</title>
<headline>MDC lands deals worth C$11.6 million.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printing and marketing firm MDC Communications Corp said it landed several stamp and printing contracts which total C$11.6 million ($8.5 million) over three years.</p>
<p>The clients are Northwest Airlines Corp, the Hong Kong Post Office and the Kingdom of Thailand.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
